  "job_B9.2.5_20251003_114956": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fea Gaius Cornelius & Lentulus Publius w\u00e6ron consulas, wear\u00f0 Cartainum fri\u00f0 aliefed from & Scipia het D hira scipa up ateon & forb\u00e6rnan; & si\u00fe\u00fean to Rome hamweard for. \u00dea him mon \u00feone triumphan ongean brohte, \u00fea eode \u00fe\u00e6r mid Terrentius, se m\u00e6ra Cartaina scop, \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s D wintrum & L, w\u00e6s geendad Punica \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6fterre Ac Romane ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s o\u00feer angunnon wi\u00f0 M\u00e6cedonie. \u00dea hluton \u00fea consulas hwelc hiera \u00e6rest \u00fe\u00e6t gewinn underfenge. \u00dea gehleat hit Quintius Flaminius, & on \u00fe\u00e6m gewinne monega gefeoht \u00feurhteah, & oftost sige & si\u00fe\u00fean he for on L\u00e6cedemonie, & Quintius Flaminius geniedde begen \u00fea cyningas \u00fe\u00e6t hie Philippus, M\u00e6cedonia cyning, sealde Demetrias his sunu, & Naui\u00f0a sealde, L\u00e6cedemonia & ealle \u00fea Romaniscan men \u00fee Hannibal on Crece geseald h\u00e6fde, him bebead se consul \u00fe\u00e6t hie On \u00fe\u00e6re tide Subres & Euoi & Cenomanni \u00fea folc hie tog\u00e6dere gesomnedon for Amilcores \u00dea sendon Romane \u00f0ider Claudius Fuluius \u00feone consul, & he hiene unea\u00f0e oferwan. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Flamineus se consul gefeaht wi\u00f0 Philippus, M\u00e6cedonia cyning, & wi\u00f0 Thraci, & \u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s M\u00e6cedoni\u00e6 eahta M ofslagen, & VI M gefangen. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Sempronius se consul wear\u00f0 ofslagen on Ispania mid ealre his firde. On \u00fe\u00e6re tide Marcellus se cons",
